sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cashier as Front Counter Cashier (POS)
    actor Cook as Kitchen Line Cook (KDS)
    actor Customer as Walk-In Customer
    participant POS as POS Component (/pos)
    participant Svc as stallDataService
    participant Store as Browser localStorage
    participant KDS as KitchenDisplayPage (/kds)
    participant Track as OrderTrackingPage (/track)

    Cashier->>POS: Adds dishes, custom notes & confirms order
    POS->>Svc: createOrder(stallId, orderPayload)
    Svc->>Svc: Allocate Token #104 & Order ORD-20261116-0004
    Svc->>Store: Write order to "fooddesk_orders"
    Svc-->>POS: Return Created Order Object
    Svc->>KDS: Dispatch CustomEvent("fooddesk:order-created")
    Svc->>Track: Dispatch Window "storage" Event

    par Dual-Screen Notification
        POS->>Cashier: Display Success Modal with giant Token #104
        KDS->>Cook: Play Kitchen Bell Sound & Display Card #104 in "Received"
        Track->>Customer: Display Milestone Step 1: "Order Received"
    end

    Note over Cook,KDS: Kitchen Cooking Stage
    Cook->>KDS: Touch "Start Preparing" on Card #104
    KDS->>Svc: updateOrderStatus(stallId, orderId, 'preparing')
    Svc->>Store: Update orderStatus to 'preparing'
    Svc->>Track: Dispatch CustomEvent("fooddesk:order-status-updated")
    KDS->>Cook: Slide Card #104 into Column 2 ("Preparing")
    Track->>Customer: Update Milestone Step 2: "Preparing (Chef is cooking)"

    Note over Cook,KDS: Food Plating & Boxing Stage
    Cook->>KDS: Touch "Mark as Ready" on Card #104
    KDS->>Svc: updateOrderStatus(stallId, orderId, 'ready')
    Svc->>Store: Update orderStatus to 'ready'
    Svc->>Track: Dispatch CustomEvent("fooddesk:order-status-updated")
    KDS->>Cook: Play Completion Chime & Slide Card to Column 3 ("Ready for Pickup")
    Track->>Customer: Pulse Emerald Banner: "YOUR ORDER IS READY! Approach Counter."

    Note over Customer,Cashier: Counter Handover Stage
    Customer->>Cashier: Approaches counter showing Token #104 slip
    Cashier->>Customer: Hands over hot food tray
    Cashier->>KDS: Touch "Complete & Serve" on Card #104
    KDS->>Svc: updateOrderStatus(stallId, orderId, 'completed')
    Svc->>Store: Update orderStatus to 'completed'
    KDS->>Cook: Slide Card #104 into Column 4 ("Completed")
    Track->>Customer: Update Milestone Step 4: "Completed & Served"

